author: pi-agent
acceptance_criteria: A binding made in an enclosing arm survives a nested case opened in the same segment; a label preceding the opener still resets the previous arm; a quoted key on a non-run block admits no phantom publish; a quoted run key remains executable; reverting either fix turns its own guard red
risk: critical
severity: critical
repro_steps: "Audit a workflow whose case arm reads b) FLAG assignment then a nested case containing the publish, all on one line: it was refused though the shell attests it. Audit a workflow whose env block uses a double-quoted key and contains an inner run block with an attested publish: it returned no failures for a workflow that publishes nothing."
component: "shell-scan.ts, attestation.ts"
