close_reason: "Arm labels are now attributed by position rather than presence, and the two block-scalar matchers are collapsed into one with the key deciding executability. Ten constructions verified by execution, including every earlier one, with no regression; both fixes revert-proof against their own guards. Full suite 425 passing, release:check green at 100 percent."
